        "scope": "Joint audit of circom-bigint and its dependency circomlib at commit cff5ab6 (= tag v2.0.5), Jul 28 to Nov 15, 2022. Picus (static analysis) was run over circomlib, and Coda (Coq) certified Num2Bits, Bits2Num, IsZero, IsEqual, LessThan, the gates and EscalarProduct. There were 10 circomlib findings, V-CIRCOMLIB-VUL-001..010, all with status 'Open'.",
