    "CommitNote": "This is tag v2.0.5, the audited commit and the latest npm release. No audit fixes were ever made: every Veridise finding is 'Open' and the report has no fix-review. circuits/ and test/circuits/ are byte-identical from v2.0.5 to HEAD 35e54ea (2025-04-03); 'git diff --stat cff5ab6 HEAD' touches only CI, LICENSE, README, package*.json and two JS tests. The older MiMC 'assigned but not constrained' bug (Kobi Gurkan, fix 109cdf4, 2019-09-17) is an ancestor of this commit, so it is fixed here."
